[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10035.67, "timestamp": "02:47:15", "text": "有时候确实会这样 [掌声]。 像个男人一样跟我打。   像个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10039.75, "timestamp": "02:47:19", "text": "男人一样跟我打。 快点。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10041.349, "timestamp": "02:47:21", "text": "，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10049.91, "timestamp": "02:47:29", "text": "天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10052.15, "timestamp": "02:47:32", "text": "我们可以打架吗？ 别拿刀了，直接"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10053.67, "timestamp": "02:47:33", "text": "开枪。   当然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10056.15, "timestamp": "02:47:36", "text": "可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10059.75, "timestamp": "02:47:39", "text": "射击。 你想射杀那把刀吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10062.15, "timestamp": "02:47:42", "text": "刀在哪儿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10064.79, "timestamp": "02:47:44", "text": "我不知道。 我必须找到它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10066.87, "timestamp": "02:47:46", "text": "左轮手枪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10068.63, "timestamp": "02:47:48", "text": "那是在教堂里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10071.15, "timestamp": "02:47:51", "text": "哦，这边"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10076.469, "timestamp": "02:47:56", "text": "。 不，我就是在这里来的。 哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10078.309, "timestamp": "02:47:58", "text": "，这里的射速真的很快"}]